{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>麥美恩去年意外缺席台慶司儀陣容而惹來雪藏揣測，昨日她強勢現身將軍澳電視城參與拜神儀式，並獲資深藝人汪明荃公開點 …</p><p></p>\n<p>麥美恩去年意外缺席台慶司儀陣容而惹來雪藏揣測，昨日她強勢現身將軍澳電視城參與拜神儀式，並獲資深藝人汪明荃公開點名力讚。面對好友林秀怡在社交平台刻意遮蓋其容貌引發熱議，她親自拆解消失一年的內幕。這次重返大型直播舞台不僅帶來全新震撼畫面，背後更隱藏著一項龐大計劃。</p>\n<h2>《萬千星輝賀台慶》麥美恩重返大騷舞台</h2>\n<p>無綫昨日於將軍澳電視城為大型節目舉行拜神儀式，全場焦點落在重新歸隊擔任司儀重任麥美恩身上，她更獲汪明荃大讚能獨當一面。活動現場星光熠熠，身旁首次挑戰直播司儀崗位並帶病上陣人母黃翠如直言希望抽中45萬大獎。麥美恩展現師姐風範承諾會在台上貼身提點對方，更發揮搞笑本色鼓勵對方為奶粉錢出盡奶力，預告屆時將天然重現極具視覺震撼經典擁抱黃金畫面。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179506034532927879_18195430746afe7279d0318.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"mayannem_1794671368_4030315510213555104_15957464.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179506034532927879_18195430746afe7279d0318.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：麥美恩IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>霸氣回應雪藏傳聞 </h2>\n<p>面對過去一年甚囂塵上遭公司投閒置散傳聞，麥美恩受訪時表現大方，堅決否認遭到雪藏。她坦言過去一年其實無停過開工，並笑言：「知道有新聞價值好感恩，多謝大家咁想念我、掛住我，都係一種福氣嚟嘅，最緊要有工開。係啊，返嚟喇！」</p>\n<h2>大讚林秀怡識玩流量</h2>\n<p>針對早前好友林秀怡上載合照時刻意遮擋其樣貌，麥美恩對此毫不介意，反而大讚對方深諳流量密碼：「佢整蠱我，佢知道咁樣遮一遮個樣一定有啲嘢玩，佢而家咪成功咗，又搶到眼球又搶到流量！」</p>\n<h2>預告《獎門人》隨傳隨到下月放長假返加國</h2>\n<p>關於外界指控減產爭議，事實上麥美恩手頭上正密鑼緊鼓籌備一個製作龐大全新綜藝項目，需要留待明年才能正式開拍。明年適逢無綫60周年以及香港回歸30周年，公司上下正準備多個大型企劃向客戶招手。她亦收到風聲指《獎門人》即將再開拍，只要曾志偉一聲令下便會隨傳隨到。完成今次主持重任後，她將於12月放長假飛返加拿大探望父母，為明年連場大戰好好充電。</p>\n<h2>網民熱議麥美恩合照期待重現經典黃金畫面</h2>\n<p>這次強勢回歸不僅打破職場失寵流言，更在網絡上掀起極大迴響。早前合照風波引發網民熱烈討論，成功搶奪大眾眼球。與此同時，歷年大會上麥美恩向得獎藝人送上緊身擁抱，一直都是網民瘋狂截圖焦點。大批觀眾紛紛在網上留言表示「最期待抱抱黃金畫面」，關注當晚直播會否再次出現充滿視覺震撼慶祝時刻。</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/176371412269973568_14311403546920244b4deef.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb 台慶 麥美恩仲開心過佢！（圖片來源：TVB截圖）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/176371412269973568_14311403546920244b4deef.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>麥美恩仲開心過佢！（圖片來源：TVB截圖）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/2b39a46a-9d3b-4db6-8adc-d36bb86f6823_999489782673cb1905b28b-1024x682.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb 台慶 麥美恩又上前抱抱兼送「肉嘴」（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/2b39a46a-9d3b-4db6-8adc-d36bb86f6823_999489782673cb1905b28b-1024x682.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>麥美恩又上前抱抱兼送「肉嘴」（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/175691225236245017_179862106168b85a7cb6c64.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶 麥美恩 李芷晴在TVB台慶奪得年度大獎，極速引起網民熱議！（圖片來源：TVB ）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/175691225236245017_179862106168b85a7cb6c64.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>李芷晴在TVB台慶奪得年度大獎，極速引起網民熱議！（圖片來源：TVB ）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179506034754759543_16097173716afe727c59a5e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"trezzFULqWqcgVLBIqh6zGwsZbBawU_XrNTubqzU7m4.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179506034754759543_16097173716afe727c59a5e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>大讚林秀怡識玩流量（圖片來源：林秀怡IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%9e%97%e7%a7%80%e6%80%a1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">林秀怡</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%90%ac%e5%8d%83%e6%98%9f%e8%bc%9d%e8%b3%80%e5%8f%b0%e6%85%b6/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">萬千星輝賀台慶</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%ba%a5%e7%be%8e%e6%81%a9/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">麥美恩</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3545709\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 19 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T05:24:04.272961+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1376,"images":5,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T03:52:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T07:47:22.143875+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T05:17:28.301541+00:00","content_hash":"e6056b3c8984cb7395c8db418d93cb1c2726e50fce88e145c8fe8a5f26d91856","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}